@0    = ~Bring me Ninafer, the fighter/mage.~
@1    = ~Hello Ninafer, it is I Callisto, your sister.~
@2    = ~Sister? So it was true after all?~
@3    = ~No. No this can't be, this is one of your tricks. You've come back to haunt me.~
@4    = ~This is no trick. I know its hard to believe, knowing the person who I used to be. I came back to see you one last time and to say I am sorry for all of the evil that I did.~
@5    = ~Corellon is a forgiving god, more than I deserve. He helped me find peace and to see the errors in my life.~
@6    = ~If its forgiveness you seek...~
@7    = ~No, I do not seek it. My... my one regret is never getting to know you, to admit we were sisters. I was afraid... afraid.~
@8    = ~What were you afraid of, Callisto? In the time that I have known you, you were afraid of nothing.~
@9    = ~I, I was afraid of the unknown. Understand that hatred is all that I knew in life, revenge is what kept me going. Love is something that would have been new to me, the love of family. I couldn't handle moving beyond the past, moving beyond the hatred that consumed me. So I pushed you away and denied that we could be sisters. I was a coward by doing that.~
@10   = ~I wasted my life on revenge, killing people regardless if they were an innocent or not. Such a waste of life, a life that should have been spent searching for you Ninafer.~
@11   = ~Well... as I was saying before, if its forgiveness you seek, I forgive you my sister. I may not understand your life and the choices you made, but I do understand being driven to the point where it controls your life.~
@12   = ~I-I just wish we could have gotten to know one another better. I miss having family.~
@13   = ~Thank you for being understanding. We do have some family Nina that you may want to search for. I remember when I was a child we used to have an aunt visit our home during the holidays. She was from Evermeet. Miralea T'sarran is her name, she was father's youngest sister. I think he has more siblings on the island, he came from a big family.~
@14   = ~We have family? Oh thank you so much for telling me. I will seek them out once I am done adventuring with <CHARNAME>.~
@15   = ~My time is coming to an end Nina, I must go.~
@16   = ~I am glad you came back, Callisto, it means a lot to me. I am glad you have found peace at last. Goodbye.~
@17   = ~Goodbye, Ninafer. Live life to its fullest, live long and do good to others.~
